WEBVTT

00:22.000 --> 00:23.240
This beach area…

00:23.320 --> 00:24.440
Didn't the authorities say

00:24.520 --> 00:27.200
that people weren't allowed
to surf or swim at this unclaimed beach?

00:27.280 --> 00:28.360
Why did someone still come?

00:28.440 --> 00:31.440
They emphasized that surfing
and swimming were prohibited here.

00:31.520 --> 00:33.200
Even so, people didn't heed their warning.

00:34.040 --> 00:34.960
Let's go.

00:42.440 --> 00:43.880
Two, three.

00:45.600 --> 00:46.800
Tend to the family members.

01:00.920 --> 01:02.880
My son!

01:14.800 --> 01:16.640
My son!

01:24.960 --> 01:26.680
-Calm down!
-You troublemaker!

01:26.760 --> 01:28.560
-Calm down!
-We can talk it over!

01:28.640 --> 01:29.840
Please don't act like this.

01:30.360 --> 01:32.680
-Master!
-Troublemaker! It's your fault!

01:32.760 --> 01:34.520
-Please calm down!
-You got my son killed!

01:34.600 --> 01:37.680
Return my son to me!

01:38.320 --> 01:40.000
What am I supposed to do?

01:42.920 --> 01:43.840
Calm down!

01:46.240 --> 01:50.880
Return my son to me!

01:51.960 --> 01:53.160
I'm sorry!

01:53.240 --> 01:55.080
He didn't like such dangerous sports

01:55.160 --> 01:58.080
before he got to know you!

01:58.160 --> 01:59.640
It's all because of you!

01:59.720 --> 02:01.720
He died because of you!

02:02.600 --> 02:04.640
It's all because
you like such stupid stuff!

02:05.680 --> 02:09.120
Why did you have to get him killed?

02:13.040 --> 02:14.960
Why?

02:16.080 --> 02:20.080
He was still so young.
He shouldn't have died.

02:45.640 --> 02:47.440
He died because of you!

02:47.520 --> 02:48.840
It's all because of you!

02:48.920 --> 02:52.160
He died because of you!

02:53.040 --> 02:53.960
Are you okay?

05:05.080 --> 05:09.880
ADAPTED FROM THE ORIGINAL WORK
"LOVER" BY SHE MU SI

05:15.000 --> 05:16.040
My brother is Song Ran,

05:17.400 --> 05:18.800
Chen Maidong's best friend.

05:20.840 --> 05:22.920
Therefore, we have
known each other since we were kids.

05:24.040 --> 05:26.080
I fell for Maidong
from the first time I met him.

05:26.960 --> 05:29.520
But he always saw me
as his friend's little sister.

05:30.880 --> 05:33.400
I spent a lot of effort
courting him and pestering him.

05:33.480 --> 05:34.920
But he never took me seriously.

05:35.720 --> 05:37.160
That was until the day

05:38.440 --> 05:40.680
I was surrounded
by hooligans outside of school.

05:41.280 --> 05:42.240
I thought to myself

05:44.080 --> 05:45.760
that it might be another opportunity.

05:47.400 --> 05:49.000
So I kept calling him.

05:51.200 --> 05:52.960
Actually, I didn't fear them at all.

05:53.040 --> 05:55.160
I just wanted Maidong to know

05:55.240 --> 05:56.880
that people fancied me as well.

05:59.400 --> 06:00.720
But he ignored me.

06:01.720 --> 06:03.040
He didn't answer any of my calls.

06:04.360 --> 06:05.880
He just notified my brother.

06:07.280 --> 06:09.360
He told my brother
to tell me to stop harassing him.

06:12.960 --> 06:14.480
Therefore, my brother

06:17.880 --> 06:19.480
was the one who showed up that day.

06:24.600 --> 06:26.520
Those people never
took my brother seriously.

06:27.840 --> 06:30.040
But in order to stand up for me,

06:30.120 --> 06:32.320
he fought them.

06:35.160 --> 06:36.840
My brother had never been
in a fight before.

06:38.480 --> 06:39.800
That was the only time.

06:59.920 --> 07:01.040
After my brother's passing,

07:02.080 --> 07:03.520
I lost my will to live.

07:04.840 --> 07:07.520
I even thought that I was the one
who was supposed to die.

07:09.840 --> 07:12.560
I never expected myself

07:12.640 --> 07:14.520
to interact with Maidong again.

07:16.360 --> 07:18.520
Even I couldn't forgive myself for it.

07:19.160 --> 07:21.240
He had no reason to forgive me.

07:38.520 --> 07:40.240
But I later realized

07:41.240 --> 07:42.880
that I wasn't
the only one who felt guilty.

07:43.920 --> 07:46.240
Maidong seemed to feel even guiltier.

07:48.720 --> 07:52.760
Only the two of us
who could truly relate to each other.

08:01.480 --> 08:02.920
Therefore, since then,

08:04.760 --> 08:07.520
Maidong has willingly taken over
my brother's responsibilities.

08:09.560 --> 08:10.840
He protected me

08:12.440 --> 08:13.400
and looked after me.

08:20.520 --> 08:22.560
He agreed to every one of my requests.

08:22.640 --> 08:25.880
He satisfied
all of the expectations I had of him.

08:27.920 --> 08:29.040
In those seven years,

08:29.800 --> 08:31.720
it was like I was
clinging on to a lifeline

08:31.800 --> 08:32.960
and unwilling to let go

08:34.360 --> 08:36.520
even though I knew clearly

08:36.600 --> 08:38.000
that he purposely blurred

08:38.080 --> 08:40.520
the lines between sympathy and love

08:40.600 --> 08:42.159
and wanted to make things up to me.

08:44.920 --> 08:46.040
But I was selfish.

08:47.840 --> 08:49.840
I thought I could last until the end

08:50.920 --> 08:52.400
by depending on my love for him.

08:52.960 --> 08:55.080
But in the end, it still ran out of steam.

08:55.160 --> 08:56.920
Therefore, I never blamed Grandma.

08:57.640 --> 08:59.200
It was indeed my fault.

09:00.400 --> 09:02.720
Maidong is a very kind person.

09:02.800 --> 09:04.640
He has experienced many misfortunes.

09:04.720 --> 09:06.760
And I took up seven years of his life too.

09:09.120 --> 09:10.960
I have many regrets.

09:11.840 --> 09:13.880
I don't know how to make it up to them.

09:14.680 --> 09:16.240
Many people are selfish.

09:17.880 --> 09:19.960
Don't blame yourself for everything.

09:27.920 --> 09:30.760
Zhuang Jie, I suppose

09:30.840 --> 09:33.120
you often get to see Maidong smile, right?

09:35.800 --> 09:36.640
No.

09:37.320 --> 09:39.440
His occupation is unique.

09:39.520 --> 09:40.600
He doesn't like to smile.

09:42.800 --> 09:44.480
You make him very happy.

09:45.120 --> 09:46.400
I can feel that.

09:47.440 --> 09:49.600
I also found out

09:49.680 --> 09:51.120
that I loved to smile

09:52.040 --> 09:53.640
after meeting my husband.

09:54.360 --> 09:57.240
You chose the right person
and have a good life.

09:58.560 --> 10:00.760
That's very important to all of us.

10:29.760 --> 10:30.600
Zhuang Jie,

10:32.560 --> 10:34.640
can you do me a favor?

10:34.720 --> 10:36.160
Treat Chen Maidong well.

10:37.960 --> 10:38.880
Make him happy.

12:38.000 --> 12:39.800
I heard you coughing from my room.

12:39.880 --> 12:40.840
Did you catch a cold?

12:41.480 --> 12:43.560
A little. Did I wake you up?

12:43.640 --> 12:44.880
You've been away for two nights.

12:44.960 --> 12:46.040
I couldn't sleep in peace.

12:46.120 --> 12:47.160
I'll take care next time.

12:47.800 --> 12:50.080
Remember to text Jie on WeChat later.

12:50.160 --> 12:51.640
She was looking for you this morning.

12:52.200 --> 12:53.320
Got it.

12:57.560 --> 12:58.640
Who is this?

13:00.840 --> 13:02.760
LIN LIHONG, 1998-2023
ZHANG MINGMEI, 1972…

13:02.840 --> 13:05.120
The boy who passed away
on the unclaimed beach.

13:05.840 --> 13:07.040
His mom gave it to me.

13:10.280 --> 13:11.680
All right. Don't dwell on it.

13:11.760 --> 13:13.360
Go to sleep after taking some medicine.

13:20.920 --> 13:22.560
His mom

13:22.640 --> 13:24.800
planned her own funeral with me.

13:25.480 --> 13:26.840
How old is she?

13:27.400 --> 13:28.760
Why is she already doing that?

13:31.520 --> 13:32.800
There is no reasoning

13:34.200 --> 13:35.200
with heartbroken people.

13:41.080 --> 13:43.480
The parent has to attend
her child's funeral.

13:45.960 --> 13:47.480
It's excruciating indeed.

13:54.080 --> 13:55.280
After all these years,

13:57.200 --> 13:59.400
she's not the only one
who has preplanned their funeral.

13:59.480 --> 14:02.440
Knowing that I was the one
holding the funeral for their loved ones,

14:03.000 --> 14:04.880
some wished that I could do the same

14:05.880 --> 14:07.040
for them as well.

14:07.600 --> 14:09.040
They could only have peace of mind

14:09.760 --> 14:11.040
when I agree to it.

14:12.200 --> 14:14.600
They feel they won't be separated
from their loved ones

14:14.680 --> 14:15.760
on the other side

14:17.000 --> 14:18.520
and might have a chance to reunite.

14:23.960 --> 14:26.200
Now you know why I can't leave Nanping.

14:28.840 --> 14:30.520
It's not just because of Master

14:31.560 --> 14:32.480
or you.

14:35.040 --> 14:36.400
I have to keep my promises to them.

14:39.320 --> 14:41.840
If I just leave this city

14:43.080 --> 14:44.360
and change my career,

14:46.280 --> 14:47.760
what should they do then?

14:49.240 --> 14:50.240
What if

14:50.840 --> 14:52.280
I am the reason

14:55.520 --> 14:56.920
they don't find each other?

14:58.560 --> 14:59.960
What if they can't be reunited?

15:04.560 --> 15:06.240
Then I'll be a heinous sinner.

15:08.080 --> 15:09.080
Maidong,

15:10.080 --> 15:12.000
your life is important as well.

15:12.960 --> 15:17.160
Sometimes, as humans,
we have to learn how to be selfish.

15:18.320 --> 15:20.640
If you lead your entire life
for the sake of other people,

15:21.200 --> 15:22.480
what will happen

15:23.120 --> 15:25.400
when you grow old and die one day?

15:26.400 --> 15:28.160
Who will you find then?

15:28.800 --> 15:30.120
Who will you be reunited with?

15:51.800 --> 15:55.080
FUNERAL CULTURE STUDIES

16:11.400 --> 16:12.400
Grandma,

16:13.320 --> 16:14.320
I'm not eating.

16:14.960 --> 16:16.240
Let me sleep for a little longer.

16:24.240 --> 16:26.160
Who are you trying to scare?

16:29.040 --> 16:31.680
You didn't answer my calls
or reply to my text messages.

16:32.240 --> 16:33.640
How dare you still sleep?

16:34.960 --> 16:37.840
You must've stolen this tumbler
from your sister again.

16:37.920 --> 16:39.640
Can you please stop bullying her?

16:40.760 --> 16:41.800
Are you worried about her?

16:41.880 --> 16:43.800
It's no wonder
Grandma thinks you're long-winded.

16:49.840 --> 16:51.040
Grandma said you were sick.

16:51.120 --> 16:52.600
Your forehead is quite hot too.

16:53.400 --> 16:54.400
I'm fine.

16:54.480 --> 16:55.720
I'll be fine in a few days.

16:57.440 --> 16:58.840
You couldn't reach me yesterday.

16:58.920 --> 17:00.240
I bet you were worried.

17:05.720 --> 17:07.079
You even threatened me.

17:08.119 --> 17:09.560
Who would I see behind your back?

17:10.520 --> 17:12.200
Something happened at the unclaimed beach

17:12.280 --> 17:13.440
near the bathhouse.

17:14.960 --> 17:16.319
I know.

17:16.400 --> 17:19.280
Yesterday, I was just spouting nonsense.

17:21.560 --> 17:23.400
All right. Go to sleep now.

17:27.640 --> 17:29.880
Let's chat. I missed you.

17:33.480 --> 17:36.400
You're pretty sweet when you're sick.

17:38.880 --> 17:40.800
Fine, I'll keep you company for a while.

17:41.360 --> 17:42.280
Come on.

17:42.360 --> 17:44.640
I have to deliver some chickens
once you're asleep.

17:45.400 --> 17:47.520
Your chickens

17:47.600 --> 17:49.360
are going to be our third wheel soon.

17:56.280 --> 17:57.440
Do you know something?

18:00.360 --> 18:02.600
I think this is my first time
being embraced like this.

18:03.960 --> 18:04.960
Nonsense.

18:06.280 --> 18:08.440
I'm sure your parents did the same

18:08.520 --> 18:10.800
when you were a baby.

18:10.880 --> 18:11.960
You just don't remember.

18:12.880 --> 18:14.560
Anyway, I think this is the first time

18:16.240 --> 18:17.680
since I could remember.

18:21.000 --> 18:22.120
My parents were too busy.

18:23.200 --> 18:25.040
My grandparents
wouldn't do something like this.

18:26.360 --> 18:27.800
After I started working,

18:29.640 --> 18:31.480
it got harder for me
to be close to others.

18:50.520 --> 18:53.520
You were the first person I saw
after waking up.

18:55.360 --> 18:56.400
That felt pretty good.

19:03.960 --> 19:04.960
Chen Maidong,

19:07.920 --> 19:09.400
will you hate me

19:10.520 --> 19:11.680
after I leave Nanping?

19:19.040 --> 19:20.400
Life is unpredictable.

19:21.120 --> 19:22.120
Nothing is predictable.

19:24.000 --> 19:25.920
We shouldn't
sacrifice ourselves for anyone.

19:28.680 --> 19:30.280
Let's spend our days to the fullest

19:31.880 --> 19:33.440
while we're still together.

19:42.760 --> 19:43.680
Chen Maidong.

19:45.240 --> 19:47.440
My career isn't as noble as yours.

19:48.600 --> 19:50.040
Shanghai isn't my home either.

19:51.240 --> 19:54.040
But they're quite important to me.

19:54.880 --> 19:56.440
I wish to be successful

19:56.520 --> 19:58.720
and be respected by other people.

19:59.520 --> 20:01.160
I wish to prove my worth.

20:03.280 --> 20:05.800
That's why I don't want
to make any compromises.

20:05.880 --> 20:06.920
I don't want

20:07.640 --> 20:10.720
to hate myself or you

20:10.800 --> 20:13.840
five years or ten years
after getting married to you.

20:15.000 --> 20:16.160
I don't want

20:16.240 --> 20:18.360
to imagine the kind of life
that I could have had.

20:21.000 --> 20:22.800
I don't want to become someone else

20:22.880 --> 20:23.920
for your sake.

20:34.360 --> 20:35.280
I support your choice.

21:03.800 --> 21:06.560
He Niaoniao, what have you done now?

21:07.480 --> 21:08.520
When will you be punished?

21:08.600 --> 21:09.920
Do you need me to be your shield?

21:10.000 --> 21:11.560
What do you know?

21:11.640 --> 21:13.640
Mom and Jie's battle of the century
will erupt soon.

21:13.720 --> 21:15.480
I'm just seeking cover beforehand.

21:16.080 --> 21:17.920
What happened between Mom and Jie?

21:18.000 --> 21:19.000
No one will tell me.

21:19.080 --> 21:20.920
How can you be that insensitive?

21:22.960 --> 21:23.920
He Niaoniao!

21:24.960 --> 21:27.160
He Niaoniao!

21:28.080 --> 21:29.960
Why are you using the vacuum cleaner?

21:30.040 --> 21:31.640
The noise gives me a headache.

21:31.720 --> 21:33.680
It even has to be charged.
Do you think we're rich?

21:33.760 --> 21:35.640
Okay, Mom. I think rags are better too.

21:37.440 --> 21:39.360
Take your sister to breakfast later.

21:39.440 --> 21:41.480
Don't eat junk
just because no one is cooking.

21:42.040 --> 21:44.480
How old are you? You can't even cook.

21:44.560 --> 21:46.480
Mom, don't worry.
We won't starve ourselves.

21:50.560 --> 21:52.000
He Niaoniao, hurry and tell me.

21:52.080 --> 21:53.240
What's wrong with Jie?

21:53.920 --> 21:56.240
What else do you think?
She got herself a boyfriend.

21:56.320 --> 21:57.760
Who is it?

21:57.840 --> 21:59.280
Isn't that a good thing?

21:59.360 --> 22:00.480
Why is Mom unhappy?

22:00.560 --> 22:01.440
Is he from our town?

22:01.520 --> 22:02.760
Do I know him?

22:02.840 --> 22:04.440
Which question do you want me to answer?

22:06.440 --> 22:07.480
Just tell me already.

22:11.080 --> 22:12.440
Jie got together with Chen Maidong.

22:12.520 --> 22:13.560
Is it really him?

22:13.640 --> 22:15.920
Jie didn't reveal it.
She didn't even tell me about it.

22:17.000 --> 22:18.800
But I eavesdropped on the phone call

22:18.880 --> 22:19.920
between Mom and Madam Wu.

22:20.000 --> 22:21.480
I think Mom caught them

22:21.560 --> 22:22.760
in an indecent act.

22:27.680 --> 22:30.400
Living expenses for two days.
Don't waste it. Don't buy drinks.

22:30.960 --> 22:31.960
Mom, we have money.

22:32.040 --> 22:33.360
Are you two making money now?

22:33.920 --> 22:35.080
Isn't it your sister's money?

22:36.080 --> 22:37.240
Don't spend her money.

22:42.880 --> 22:45.240
Lin, I have something to discuss with you.

22:45.880 --> 22:47.160
Don't be angry at me.

22:48.240 --> 22:52.560
You'll be alone after I leave.

22:53.040 --> 22:54.960
Why don't you follow me to Shanghai?

22:55.440 --> 22:56.440
This won't do.

22:56.520 --> 22:57.720
I have to rephrase that.

22:59.800 --> 23:02.600
Lin, you're more creative than me.

23:02.680 --> 23:04.360
You're more intelligent than me too.

23:04.440 --> 23:06.960
If you had a silly grandson like mine,

23:07.040 --> 23:10.000
wouldn't you make him go to Shanghai too?

23:10.080 --> 23:13.280
I think Jie will be the only one for him.

23:15.880 --> 23:16.960
Please make way.

23:18.960 --> 23:21.160
What's going on?
Why are you surrounding the place?

23:22.560 --> 23:24.880
Madam Wu is inside.
Hurry inside and take a look.

23:26.040 --> 23:27.160
Please make way.

23:27.240 --> 23:32.080
LIN BAOBAO VETERINARY CLINIC

23:34.480 --> 23:35.320
Mrs. Chen?

23:35.400 --> 23:36.600
What are you guys doing here?

23:42.320 --> 23:44.880
What are you doing?
Are you seizing her house?

23:44.960 --> 23:46.160
Where's Ms. Lin?

23:46.240 --> 23:47.760
Why are you only here now?

23:47.840 --> 23:49.000
Answer my question.

23:49.080 --> 23:50.880
She was just taken away by the ambulance.

23:50.960 --> 23:52.800
What? Ambulance?

23:52.880 --> 23:55.280
Why is Ms. Lin in an ambulance?

23:57.520 --> 23:58.800
Did you have no idea either?

24:01.240 --> 24:03.240
Ms. Lin has a brain tumor.

24:04.120 --> 24:05.120
It's malignant.

24:05.760 --> 24:07.040
The doctor said

24:08.040 --> 24:09.560
she doesn't have much time left.

25:35.120 --> 25:36.040
Grandma?

25:38.960 --> 25:39.840
Grandma?

25:41.920 --> 25:42.840
Grandma?

25:47.560 --> 25:49.200
She's not answering my calls again.

26:00.720 --> 26:04.760
MADAM WU

26:16.240 --> 26:17.880
Yan cooked all afternoon.

26:18.840 --> 26:19.680
I can tell.

26:19.760 --> 26:21.360
The dishes look healthy.

26:28.760 --> 26:29.600
Here it comes.

26:30.280 --> 26:31.400
Yan, did you make fish too?

26:42.920 --> 26:44.800
There's no steam coming from any of them.

26:45.520 --> 26:46.840
But they're cooked.

26:46.920 --> 26:47.920
I know how to cook now.

26:48.000 --> 26:50.640
Protein and carbohydrates
cover all the nutrients we need.

26:50.720 --> 26:52.160
What a waste of food.

26:52.240 --> 26:55.200
Mom, there are only four of us here.

26:55.280 --> 26:56.880
You shouldn't be mad at all three of us.

26:56.960 --> 26:58.960
Can't I even express my opinion now?

26:59.040 --> 27:00.160
Who made up that rule?

27:00.240 --> 27:01.120
Precisely.

27:01.200 --> 27:03.520
Mom can say whatever she wants. I love it.

27:05.120 --> 27:06.160
Have some mashed potatoes.

27:12.920 --> 27:14.600
Jie, try this.

27:15.080 --> 27:16.800
I made this oil and vinegar sauce.

27:16.880 --> 27:19.200
If you like it,
I'll cook for Chinese New Year.

27:19.280 --> 27:20.280
-Don't.
-Just forget it.

27:27.440 --> 27:30.080
Mom, you should
assign some jobs to me tomorrow.

27:30.160 --> 27:31.600
I don't have a lot of homework.

27:31.680 --> 27:33.160
It's time for me to help out.

27:33.240 --> 27:34.840
Mom, me too.

27:34.920 --> 27:36.280
Just order me around.

27:37.600 --> 27:39.120
Fine, I'll see how it goes.

27:39.200 --> 27:41.080
I can't just make up tasks for you to do.

27:41.880 --> 27:43.160
Liao Tao!

27:43.240 --> 27:44.480
Liao Tao!

27:44.560 --> 27:45.800
Liao Tao!

27:46.800 --> 27:47.800
Liao Tao!

27:48.320 --> 27:49.240
What's wrong?

27:49.320 --> 27:50.640
Hurry and tell me

27:50.720 --> 27:53.640
where Mrs. Chen was heading!

27:53.720 --> 27:55.280
We searched all of Xingshan Mountain!

27:55.360 --> 27:56.600
We couldn't find her!

27:56.680 --> 27:57.960
The sun has set already!

27:58.040 --> 28:00.520
Madam Wu, what happened to Mrs. Chen?

28:00.600 --> 28:02.040
It's all my fault!

28:02.120 --> 28:03.120
It's my big mouth.

28:03.200 --> 28:05.280
I didn't think before I spoke.

28:05.360 --> 28:06.600
I told her

28:06.680 --> 28:08.760
that Ms. Lin was taken away
by an ambulance

28:08.840 --> 28:10.120
and didn't have much time left.

28:10.200 --> 28:12.040
-It must've been a shock.
-Just look at you.

28:12.120 --> 28:13.160
Zhuang Jie!

28:14.560 --> 28:15.840
You guys should know better!

28:15.920 --> 28:17.880
-Hurry and go after your sister!
-Okay.

28:17.960 --> 28:19.720
Good children! Hurry and search for her!

28:19.800 --> 28:20.680
Okay.

28:22.040 --> 28:23.360
-Grandma!
-Mrs. Chen!

28:23.440 --> 28:25.320
-Mrs. Chen!
-Grandma!

28:25.400 --> 28:32.000
-Mrs. Chen!
-Mrs. Chen!

28:32.080 --> 28:33.760
-Grandma!
-Mrs. Chen!

28:33.840 --> 28:36.320
Mrs. Chen!

28:37.240 --> 28:39.400
-Mrs. Chen!
-Mrs. Chen!

28:39.480 --> 28:40.360
Hong Xu!

28:40.920 --> 28:41.840
How is it?

28:41.920 --> 28:42.960
I didn't see her.

28:43.040 --> 28:44.560
She's not on the northern side.

28:44.640 --> 28:45.880
Chen Maidong!

28:46.520 --> 28:47.520
What are you doing here?

28:47.600 --> 28:48.960
Why didn't you tell me?

28:49.040 --> 28:51.080
You have difficulty walking.
You would just worry.

28:51.160 --> 28:52.760
What kind of thinking is that?

28:53.280 --> 28:56.520
-Mrs. Chen!
-Mrs. Chen!

28:56.600 --> 28:58.360
All right. Don't panic.

28:58.440 --> 29:00.400
It will be fine.
All of us are searching for her.

29:00.480 --> 29:02.480
-Mrs. Chen!
-Mrs. Chen!

29:02.560 --> 29:05.600
-Mrs. Chen!
-Mrs. Chen!

29:05.680 --> 29:06.840
It's my fault.

29:06.920 --> 29:09.520
Grandma always said that she has
walked this path countless times.

29:09.600 --> 29:11.080
She told me not to call her.

29:11.160 --> 29:12.160
That's why I didn't call.

29:13.960 --> 29:15.480
Calm down. She'll definitely be fine.

29:15.560 --> 29:17.800
I think she just couldn't accept reality

29:17.880 --> 29:19.520
and just wanted to find a quiet spot.

29:21.480 --> 29:23.240
I already searched
the places she frequents.

29:23.320 --> 29:24.600
The bus terminal.

29:24.680 --> 29:26.800
I went to the hospital where Ms. Lin is.
No one saw her.

29:27.680 --> 29:29.280
If we can't find her,

29:29.360 --> 29:30.600
we should call the cops.

29:30.680 --> 29:31.840
-Mrs. Chen!
-Mrs. Chen!

29:33.440 --> 29:35.080
-Mrs. Chen!
-Mrs. Chen!

29:36.000 --> 29:37.800
-Let's search for a little longer.
-Mrs. Chen!

29:37.880 --> 29:39.120
Grandma is a prideful person.

29:39.200 --> 29:40.280
If it's just a false alarm

29:40.360 --> 29:41.920
and we made such a big fuss for her,

29:42.000 --> 29:43.520
she would definitely get angry.

29:44.080 --> 29:46.040
All right. Then we should keep in touch.

29:46.120 --> 29:47.200
All right. Don't go too far.

29:47.280 --> 29:48.880
Take them home if they get exhausted.

29:48.960 --> 29:50.480
All right. Stop worrying about us.

29:50.560 --> 29:51.520
-Go on.
-Mrs. Chen!

29:51.600 --> 29:53.840
-Come on. Let's search over there.
-Let's go.

29:53.920 --> 29:55.040
Mrs. Chen!

29:56.160 --> 29:57.440
Maidong, don't panic, okay?

29:57.520 --> 29:59.440
-Mrs. Chen!
-Let's go.

29:59.520 --> 30:01.360
-Mrs. Chen!
-Mrs. Chen!

30:03.640 --> 30:05.200
Grandma!

30:05.280 --> 30:06.320
Mrs. Chen!

30:06.400 --> 30:07.880
-Mrs. Chen!
-Mrs. Chen!

30:09.160 --> 30:10.200
Mrs. Chen!

30:10.840 --> 30:12.320
-Mrs. Chen!
-Mrs. Chen!

30:13.080 --> 30:14.360
Wait.

30:14.440 --> 30:15.720
Did you guys hear something?

30:15.800 --> 30:16.840
Is it our pet goose?

30:17.760 --> 30:18.760
It does sound like it.

30:20.920 --> 30:22.200
Why does it sound so strange?

30:22.960 --> 30:24.720
It has a terrible temper,
just like our mom.

30:24.800 --> 30:26.560
It does that when it's thirsty and hungry.

30:27.120 --> 30:28.720
All right, I'll go and check it out.

30:28.800 --> 30:31.720
You two can check over there.
Call me if you find anything.

30:31.800 --> 30:32.680
-Okay.
-Stay there.

30:32.760 --> 30:33.800
-All right.
-Got it.

30:33.880 --> 30:35.040
Mrs. Chen!

30:35.120 --> 30:36.720
Mrs. Chen!

30:36.800 --> 30:38.160
Mrs. Chen!

31:21.680 --> 31:24.920
Chen Maidong, I found your grandma.

31:26.200 --> 31:27.160
She is

31:28.280 --> 31:30.080
under the bridge, westward.

31:30.160 --> 31:31.920
It's fine. Don't panic. Take your time.

31:32.000 --> 31:33.040
I'm keeping an eye on her.

32:34.960 --> 32:36.760
Put this on after you take a bath.

32:40.440 --> 32:42.600
Is no one more capable
than you in the town?

32:43.280 --> 32:45.160
Mom, you should stop reprimanding Jie.

32:45.240 --> 32:48.320
She just got a scratch on her way back.
She'll be fine.

32:48.400 --> 32:50.240
Besides, you should show some empathy.

32:50.320 --> 32:52.360
Didn't you join us for the search too?

33:16.240 --> 33:17.240
Zhuang Jie.

33:18.360 --> 33:19.800
If you choose Chen Maidong,

33:20.320 --> 33:22.360
this will be your life in the future.

33:22.440 --> 33:24.320
His grandma will only keep aging.

33:24.400 --> 33:26.600
You will have
more and more causes of concern.

33:26.680 --> 33:28.560
Do you want your career
and a peaceful life?

33:28.640 --> 33:29.520
There's no way.

33:30.320 --> 33:31.480
If anything happens,

33:31.560 --> 33:33.280
you'll have no other adults to depend on.

33:33.360 --> 33:36.200
No one will help raise your child.
You'll have to do everything yourself.

33:36.800 --> 33:39.520
I'll see how you can
enjoy your love life like that.

33:39.600 --> 33:41.160
Mom, didn't I tell you already?

33:41.240 --> 33:42.960
I'll return to Shanghai
after the New Year.

33:43.040 --> 33:45.760
You shouldn't be so zealous
if you don't plan to stay.

33:45.840 --> 33:46.840
You'll cause trouble.

33:46.920 --> 33:48.200
Your physical condition

33:48.280 --> 33:49.400
and his background

33:49.480 --> 33:51.080
are both burdens.

33:51.160 --> 33:52.200
Draw a line with him.

33:52.280 --> 33:53.680
Don't waste each other's time.

34:01.480 --> 34:02.560
-Jie.
-I'm fine.

34:02.640 --> 34:03.800
You two should sleep early.

34:19.080 --> 34:19.920
Here.

34:23.719 --> 34:25.960
I already told you I'm fine.

34:27.120 --> 34:28.560
Why did you have to bring me here?

34:28.639 --> 34:29.560
What's wrong with you?

34:30.239 --> 34:31.600
This kind of building is warm.

34:32.360 --> 34:33.400
A change of environment

34:33.480 --> 34:34.639
will improve your mood.

34:35.520 --> 34:36.600
A better mood?

34:37.199 --> 34:39.280
I'm annoyed by the elevator.

34:39.360 --> 34:40.520
It keeps swaying.

34:40.600 --> 34:42.440
It's as if I'm descending to hell.

34:43.480 --> 34:45.080
You don't like elevators, do you?

34:45.679 --> 34:47.600
You even said you would go
to Shanghai with me.

34:49.840 --> 34:50.880
I'm not going anymore.

34:51.800 --> 34:52.719
I'm old now.

34:53.239 --> 34:54.719
It's pointless no matter where I go.

34:55.719 --> 34:57.520
I can't even be bothered to come here.

35:14.280 --> 35:15.840
You and Jie

35:16.400 --> 35:17.960
are both in your prime.

35:18.640 --> 35:19.720
You two should go.

35:20.720 --> 35:22.600
Just come back
and visit me when you're free.

35:31.920 --> 35:32.960
Let's drop the topic.

35:34.920 --> 35:36.640
I'll go wherever you go.

35:37.600 --> 35:39.480
Don't be silly.

35:39.560 --> 35:42.640
No one can keep another person company
for the rest of their lives.

35:46.760 --> 35:47.840
Grandma,

35:48.880 --> 35:50.480
why don't I apply for leave tomorrow?

35:50.560 --> 35:52.200
I'll take you to the provincial hospital

35:52.280 --> 35:53.280
to visit Ms. Lin.

35:56.600 --> 35:57.480
No need.

35:58.600 --> 35:59.520
She won't allow it.

36:00.800 --> 36:01.720
How would you know?

36:04.680 --> 36:06.600
I reached the train station
this afternoon.

36:07.800 --> 36:10.480
I came back because she told me off.

36:12.040 --> 36:13.200
Never in my life

36:14.400 --> 36:16.640
have I ever seen her this angry.

36:19.840 --> 36:21.720
No one knows this better than Ms. Lin.

36:22.280 --> 36:25.000
You kept Grandpa company
in the hospital when he was sick.

36:25.080 --> 36:26.640
You almost couldn't take it.

36:26.720 --> 36:28.680
I'm sure she doesn't
want that for you again.

36:29.720 --> 36:31.520
Although her life was saved not long ago,

36:32.600 --> 36:34.680
she shouted loudly at me.

36:34.760 --> 36:37.200
I'm worried that her ailment
might act up again.

36:38.120 --> 36:41.320
That's good too. You should listen to her.

36:42.560 --> 36:44.440
Who else can I listen to?

36:45.360 --> 36:47.400
In the past, I always depended on her

36:47.480 --> 36:49.920
to make all of my decisions for me.

36:50.440 --> 36:51.520
But now,

36:52.640 --> 36:55.600
she's abandoning me all of a sudden.

36:57.200 --> 36:58.920
I finally figured it out now.

36:59.760 --> 37:01.040
Life is just a journey

37:01.960 --> 37:05.120
passing through various destinations.

37:05.200 --> 37:07.640
In the end, we have to enter our graves.

37:08.920 --> 37:10.360
No one can avoid it.

37:11.800 --> 37:13.640
We should live our lives to the fullest.

37:26.720 --> 37:27.600
Grandma,

37:29.640 --> 37:30.880
you must live well.

37:32.760 --> 37:34.000
Do it for my sake.

37:35.720 --> 37:38.160
I already told you I'm fine.

37:38.240 --> 37:40.400
Why are you still so long-winded?

37:40.480 --> 37:42.960
It's not like there's no cure for Ms. Lin.

37:43.040 --> 37:44.560
She should be hospitalized

37:44.640 --> 37:46.080
and go for chemotherapy.

37:46.640 --> 37:48.480
She's in a good state of mind.

37:48.560 --> 37:51.400
Maybe she'll even live longer than me.

37:59.240 --> 38:00.440
I'm sure you two

38:01.280 --> 38:02.480
will live long lives.

38:04.960 --> 38:07.720
I didn't know
that you could say such nice words.

38:10.280 --> 38:11.680
Enough already.

38:11.760 --> 38:12.920
Wash up and go to sleep.

38:16.880 --> 38:18.080
Is your grandma asleep?

38:22.200 --> 38:23.160
How is your leg?

38:24.040 --> 38:25.760
It's just a scratch. Don't worry.

38:28.360 --> 38:29.600
Do you truly think

38:29.680 --> 38:31.520
your grandma has gotten over it?

38:36.800 --> 38:38.040
She's brokenhearted.

38:39.200 --> 38:40.240
I can feel it.

38:42.040 --> 38:44.960
I should keep her company more often.

38:47.680 --> 38:49.520
You're her only kin now.

38:50.080 --> 38:52.160
She suddenly has no one to talk to.

38:53.120 --> 38:54.200
She still has you.

38:55.600 --> 38:57.080
Wasn't it troublesome?

38:57.160 --> 38:58.360
You came to my house so often.

39:00.880 --> 39:02.160
I'll be coming even more often.

39:02.240 --> 39:03.640
I'll visit your grandma every day.

39:04.600 --> 39:05.720
Stop bragging.

39:06.440 --> 39:08.280
You'll be staying
for a few more months at most.

39:08.360 --> 39:10.160
Forget about keeping Grandma company.

39:10.240 --> 39:13.440
We didn't even get to go on a decent date.

39:13.520 --> 39:14.840
Let's go on a date then.

39:14.920 --> 39:16.400
I was waiting for you to make a move.

39:20.000 --> 39:21.280
Let's catch a movie then.

39:22.880 --> 39:24.080
Otherwise,

39:24.840 --> 39:26.200
our relationship would seem fake

39:27.800 --> 39:29.440
when we look back on it.

39:45.280 --> 39:49.960
SPARKLING NEW YEAR'S EVE

39:50.040 --> 39:53.480
SPARKLING NEW YEAR'S EVE

40:04.560 --> 40:06.600
Stop running. You're already late anyway.

40:08.120 --> 40:09.400
My mom came back late today.

40:09.480 --> 40:11.560
Something happened at the factory.
Dinner was delayed.

40:11.640 --> 40:12.840
I didn't dare to leave early.

40:12.920 --> 40:13.800
Look at us.

40:13.880 --> 40:15.920
It's like we're teens
sneaking out on a date.

40:16.000 --> 40:17.760
Sorry about that. Let's go inside.

40:18.720 --> 40:20.320
The movie started 40 minutes ago.

40:20.400 --> 40:22.480
Even if we go in now,
we won't know what's going on.

40:23.760 --> 40:25.200
Forget it then.

40:25.280 --> 40:26.720
I'm too tired to catch another one.

40:26.800 --> 40:29.200
Why don't we sit here for a while?

40:29.280 --> 40:31.120
We can't stay out too late anyway.

40:51.880 --> 40:52.800
You smell great.

40:52.880 --> 40:55.120
Did you put on some cologne?

40:55.200 --> 40:57.680
I wouldn't even have bathed
if I knew we would sit on the floor.

40:59.120 --> 41:00.120
How dare you laugh?

41:00.200 --> 41:02.840
You don't take this date seriously.
You reek of hot pot.

41:02.920 --> 41:04.000
Hot pot is fast.

41:04.080 --> 41:06.640
I had to whip up something quick
for them if I wanted to come out.

41:06.720 --> 41:08.600
Besides, I don't know
how to cook anything else.

41:09.280 --> 41:10.120
I know how to cook.

41:10.960 --> 41:12.000
Spend more time with me.

41:12.080 --> 41:13.320
I'll make sure you won't starve.

41:14.800 --> 41:16.000
Maidong, you're so cool.

41:22.560 --> 41:23.880
Maidong, you're even cooler now.

41:23.960 --> 41:25.840
You're really annoying, aren't you?

41:28.640 --> 41:30.000
Maidong, are you Doraemon?

41:30.080 --> 41:32.360
Come. Let me search your pockets.

41:32.920 --> 41:33.960
-Let me see.
-Don't touch!

41:37.840 --> 41:40.000
Maidong, you even have lip balm!

41:40.080 --> 41:41.360
Do you use the same brand as me?

41:41.960 --> 41:43.160
What's with all the crap?

41:43.640 --> 41:45.440
Don't people go on dates to talk crap?

41:56.240 --> 41:57.320
I wanted lip balm.

41:57.400 --> 41:59.040
How could you take advantage of me?

41:59.720 --> 42:00.560
Help!

42:00.640 --> 42:03.080
Chen Maidong is taking advantage
of a young girl!

42:03.160 --> 42:04.800
Have you lost your mind?

42:05.800 --> 42:06.960
Try to scream now.

42:10.600 --> 42:12.880
I was just teasing you. What's wrong?

42:12.960 --> 42:14.880
Why do you look so guilty?

42:15.600 --> 42:17.480
They might not know you,
but everyone knows me.

42:18.240 --> 42:19.600
After you leave,

42:19.680 --> 42:21.200
I'll be left with more gossip about me.

42:22.600 --> 42:23.520
Got it.

42:24.520 --> 42:26.280
Maidong, I know you're a public figure.

42:26.360 --> 42:28.240
You're pretty flamboyant, aren't you?

42:32.040 --> 42:34.520
Are you cold? Why don't I send you home?

42:34.600 --> 42:37.560
No, we have to sit here
at least until the movie is over.

42:40.000 --> 42:40.880
All right.

42:47.560 --> 42:48.560
Chen Maidong.

42:50.480 --> 42:52.680
I was late today. It's my fault.

42:53.600 --> 42:56.800
We should overcome all obstacles
on New Year's Eve

42:56.880 --> 42:58.480
and go on a proper date.

43:03.360 --> 43:04.200
Sure.

43:07.880 --> 43:08.880
I want popcorn.

43:14.600 --> 43:15.680
Let me show you a trick.

43:19.840 --> 43:20.960
Can you do it?

43:30.520 --> 43:32.200
Again! Do it again!

45:56.560 --> 46:03.000
ALL ANIMALS IN THIS PROGRAM
WERE TREATED KINDLY
